"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-06T17:28:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T17:39:17Z","closed_at":"2025-08-22T17:39:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.beta5, 4.5.beta4\n- Not reproducible in 4.4.1stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.94 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI've created an extended class of `ImageTexture` which purpose it to let me easily create simple textures without leaving the editor. This has been working fine since 4.0, but in 4.5 the editor freezes as soon as I edit a color of the ImageTexture (See code below). I've tested exporting an int in the same way, also using `set_image(image)` but then it doesn't crash.\n\nSomething worth pointing out is that:\n1. Even if it works in 4.4 without freezes, the colorpicker closes as soon as I change the color.\n2. In 4.5 when instead clicking the \"reset\" icon the color changes but the editor doesn't freeze.\n3. From my testing it seems like you must be extending the ImageTexture class with a color for it to freeze, calling `set_image` from another script that has a exported color setter doesn't trigger it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a class like this:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name CustomTexture extends ImageTexture\n\nvar image = Image.create(50,50,false,Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n\n# Editing this freezes the editor in 4.5\n@export var color:Color = Color.WHITE:\n\tset(value):\n\t\tcolor = value\n\t\tset_image(image)\n```\nWhen creating a resource of this class and editing the color property the editor will freeze for what looks like indefinitely. When closing the project the \"are you sure you want to close\" still triggers, but other than that it's completely in-responsive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee class above or provided file. This project also has an int variable in the custom texture to show that that part still works.\n\n[colorpickerfreeze.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21626443/colorpickerfreeze.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109367/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}